    a number called 'the guard' is 'rng below' of 'the guard span'.
    a text called decl is "a number called u{gen_whiles} is 0".
    a text called 'loop line' is "While u{gen_whiles} is less than {'the limit'}, Print u{gen_whiles}, If u{gen_whiles} is equal to {'the guard'} then, Break. Increment u{gen_whiles}".
    a text called 'read line' is "Print u{gen_whiles}".
    a list called 'the lines' is [decl, 'loop line', 'read line'].
