To 'gen leaf loop continue while' with a text called indent and a boolean called nested.
    Set gen_whiles to gen_whiles add 1.
    a number called 'the limit' is 'rng below' of 5 add 2.
    a number called 'the guard span' is 'the limit' add 2.
    a number called 'the guard' is 'rng below' of 'the guard span'.
    a text called decl is "a number called u{gen_whiles} is 0".
    a text called 'loop line' is "While u{gen_whiles} is less than {'the limit'}, Increment u{gen_whiles}, If u{gen_whiles} is equal to {'the guard'} then, Continue. Print u{gen_whiles}".
